{
  "name": "data_insight",
  "title": "多 Agent 经营数据诊断",
  "version": 3,
  "final_node": "report",
  "review_node": "review",
  "backtrack_to": "report",
  "backtrack_rounds": 1,
  "backtrack_attempts": 1,
  "max_rounds": 3,
  "budget_tokens": 200000,
  "inputs": {
    "dataset": "data/sales.csv",
    "question": "2026 年前三季度各区域营收结构如何？哪些区域/品类存在结构性异常？给出 3 条可执行的经营建议。"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "profile",
      "role": "data_profiler",
      "depends_on": [],
      "candidates": [
        "profiler-a"
      ],
      "task": "请探查数据集 {dataset} 的结构与质量。业务问题背景：{question}",
      "tools": [
        "csv_profile"
      ],
      "verify": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "timeout_s": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "clean",
      "role": "cleaner",
      "depends_on": [
        "profile"
      ],
      "candidates": [
        "cleaner-a"
      ],
      "task": "依据探查报告给出清洗规则清单与影响记录数。\n[探查报告]\n{profile}",
      "tools": [],
      "verify": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "timeout_s": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "analyze_a",
      "role": "analyst",
      "depends_on": [
        "clean"
      ],
      "candidates": [
        "analyst-a"
      ],
      "task": "从『规模与排名』角度完成经营分析：各区域营收、订单数、单均营收的排序，以及量价结构差异。数字必须来自事实表。\n[业务问题]\n{question}\n[清洗结论]\n{clean}",
      "tools": [
        "sql_query"
      ],
      "tool_args": {
        "query": "SELECT region, ROUND(SUM(revenue),2) AS rev, COUNT(*) AS orders, ROUND(SUM(revenue)/COUNT(*),2) AS avg_rev FROM sales GROUP BY region ORDER BY rev DESC"
      },
      "verify": [
        "rule",
        "recompute"
      ],
      "timeout_s": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "analyze_b",
      "role": "analyst",
      "depends_on": [
        "clean"
      ],
      "candidates": [
        "analyst-b"
      ],
      "task": "从『异常与交叉』角度独立完成经营分析：找出与整体均值背离的区域、品类结构异常、以及可能的成因假设。同样以事实表为准。\n[业务问题]\n{question}\n[清洗结论]\n{clean}",
      "tools": [
        "sql_query"
      ],
      "tool_args": {
        "query": "SELECT product, ROUND(SUM(revenue),2) AS rev, COUNT(*) AS orders, ROUND(SUM(revenue)/COUNT(*),2) AS avg_rev FROM sales GROUP BY product ORDER BY rev DESC"
      },
      "verify": [
        "rule",
        "recompute"
      ],
      "required_facts": [],
      "timeout_s": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "arbitrate",
      "role": "arbiter",
      "depends_on": [
        "analyze_a",
        "analyze_b"
      ],
      "candidates": [
        "arbiter-a"
      ],
      "task": "两位分析师独立完成了同一份数据的分析，请比对并仲裁，输出唯一的合并结论。一致处直接采纳，矛盾处指出分歧并判定哪一方有事实依据。\n[分析师 A：规模与排名]\n{analyze_a}\n\n[分析师 B：异常与交叉]\n{analyze_b}",
      "tools": [],
      "verify": [
        "rule",
        "cross",
        "recompute"
      ],
      "cross_with": [
        "analyze_a",
        "analyze_b"
      ],
      "advisory": [
        "cross"
      ],
      "timeout_s": 150,
      "max_tokens": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "deep_dive",
      "role": "analyst",
      "depends_on": [
        "arbitrate"
      ],
      "candidates": [
        "analyst-a",
        "analyst-b"
      ],
      "task": "对仲裁结论中的异常切片做深挖，说明成因假设与验证方法。\n[仲裁结论]\n{arbitrate}",
      "tools": [
        "sql_query"
      ],
      "tool_args": {
        "query": "SELECT region, product, ROUND(SUM(revenue),2) AS rev, COUNT(*) AS orders, ROUND(SUM(revenue)/COUNT(*),2) AS avg_rev FROM sales GROUP BY region, product ORDER BY region, rev DESC"
      },
      "verify": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "when": "outlier_count > 0",
      "timeout_s": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "report",
      "role": "writer",
      "depends_on": [
        "arbitrate",
        "deep_dive"
      ],
      "candidates": [
        "writer-a"
      ],
      "task": "撰写管理层诊断报告。数字必须原样搬运，不得改动。\n[仲裁结论]\n{arbitrate}\n[深挖结论]\n{deep_dive}",
      "tools": [],
      "verify": [
        "rule",
        "recompute"
      ],
      "rule": {
        "min_len": 300,
        "min_headings": 3,
        "complete_ending": true
      },
      "timeout_s": 120,
      "max_tokens": 6000
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "role": "reviewer",
      "depends_on": [
        "report"
      ],
      "candidates": [
        "reviewer-a"
      ],
      "task": "逐条核对下列报告中每个数字的出处，给出 通过/不通过 与问题清单。\n[报告]\n{report}\n[事实表]\n{profile}\n[本次工具证据（上游节点实际取到的数据，报告引用它们属于合法）]\n{tool_evidence}",
      "tools": [],
      "verify": [
        "llm_judge"
      ],
      "judge_by_model": true,
      "max_attempts": 1,
      "timeout_s": 150
    }
  ]
}
